<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 675 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 675 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said Project A overnight agricultural contracts trading volume totalled 675 contracts.</p>
<p>There were 58 wheat, 310 corn, 294 soybean, one soymeal and one soyoil contract traded, along with one wheat call, five corn calls, one corn put, one soybean put and three soymeal calls.</p>
<p>--Sam Nelson 312-408-8721</p>
